OL,3,CCCTV reveals honeytrap pair buying
OL,4,Cwine to spike victim with drugs
OL,6,FCCTV footage has revealed the moment a
OL,7,FRomanian couple stop to buy wine at a
OL,8,Fpetrol station which they later spike
OL,9,Fto drug one of their victims.
OL,11,FAdina Mihai, 31, who was posing as a
OL,12,Fsex worker, and her partner Madalin
OL,13,FDumitru, 30, have today been jailed
OL,14,Ffor 17 years each for the manslaughter
OL,15,Fof Malcolm King, 80, from
OL,16,FGloucestershire, and Gary Mouat, 37,
OL,17,Ffrom Oxfordshire.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
