OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786733347
OL,3,CCCTV reveals honeytrap pair buying
OL,4,Cwine to spike victim with drugs
OL,6,FIn footage released by Thames Valley
OL,7,FPolice, the couple can be seen pulling
OL,8,Finto the Morrison's petrol station in
OL,9,FBanbury on the evening of 12 July 2025.
OL,11,FDumitru, who's driving, then gets out
OL,12,Fof the car and proceeds to enter the
OL,13,Fshop, before returning with wine he
OL,14,Fpurchased.
OL,16,FMihai remains in the passenger seat of
OL,17,Fthe car.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
