PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786733347
OL,3,CCCTV reveals honeytrap pair buying
OL,4,Cwine to spike victim with drugs
OL,6,FThe couple were on their way to Gary
OL,7,FMouat's address in Banbury, one of two
OL,8,Fmen who died after their drinks were
OL,9,Fspiked with the drug GBL.
OL,11,FThe court heard that on the night of
OL,12,FMr Mouat's death, his wife and son
OL,13,Fwere away for the night, and he
OL,14,Fcontacted Adina Mihai via Vivastreet.
OL,16,FThe pair then travelled from Ilford to
OL,17,FMr Mouat's home.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
