OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786733347
OL,3,CCCTV reveals honeytrap pair buying
OL,4,Cwine to spike victim with drugs
OL,6,FMr Mouat drank wine laced with GBL and
OL,7,FMihai left him unconscious, while she
OL,8,Fsearched for items to steal from the
OL,9,Fhouse.
OL,11,FHe was found the following morning
OL,12,Flying on the floor of his lounge by
OL,13,Ffamily friends who had been concerned
OL,14,Fthat he had not been in contact with
OL,15,Fanyone since the previous day.
OL,17,FAn open bottle of wine was found
OL,18,Fnearby with two wine glasses, which
OL,19,Fpolice say was similar to the scene at
OL,20,FMalcolm King's house the year before.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
