PN,38705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786733347
OL,3,CCCTV reveals honeytrap pair buying
OL,4,Cwine to spike victim with drugs
OL,6,FThe couple also recorded a TikTok
OL,7,Fvideo of themselves on their way to
OL,8,FGary Mouat's address in Banbury on the
OL,9,Fnight.
OL,11,FIn social media footage released by
OL,12,FThames Valley Police, Adina Mihai can
OL,13,Fbe seen singing along to music, posing
OL,14,Finto the camera.
OL,16,FThe defendants, who are both
OL,17,Funemployed and in a relationship,
OL,18,Fpreviously lived in Birmingham, before
OL,19,Fmoving to Ilford.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
