PN,38706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786733347
OL,3,CCCTV reveals honeytrap pair buying
OL,4,Cwine to spike victim with drugs
OL,6,FThe court heard Mihai advertised her
OL,7,Fsexual services on the online site
OL,8,FVivaStreet and the pair would take
OL,9,Fcash deposits ahead of meeting up.
OL,11,FDumitru would drive her to an address
OL,12,Fand wait outside as she went about the
OL,13,Fdrugging and theft.
OL,15,FShe would find out whether their
OL,16,Fvictims were wealthy and would steal
OL,17,Fwatches, jewellery, aftershave and
OL,18,Fcash.
OL,20,FThe value of goods stolen or amount of
OL,21,Fcash taken is unknown.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
