PN,38707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786733347
OL,3,CCCTV reveals honeytrap pair buying
OL,4,Cwine to spike victim with drugs
OL,6,FThe couple were arrested on 31 July
OL,7,Flast year (2025) and charged on 6
OL,8,FAugust last year following Mr Mouat's
OL,9,Fdeath.
OL,11,FThey were further charged on 24 April
OL,12,Fthis year (2026) in relation to Mr
OL,13,FKing's death.
OL,15,FThe couple have been sentenced to a
OL,16,Ftotal of 34 years at Oxford Crown
OL,17,FCourt.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
